    },
    "campfire": {
      "_doc": "03 §2 — the campfire's rest option heals healPctMaxHp of Max HP. Flat across chapters: it is a share of a run-scoped maximum, so it takes no M(c) or G(c) scalar. The campfire's other two options (upgrade a perk tier, +2 Reroll Charges) move no currency and are authored where those systems are.",
      "healPctMaxHp": 0.4
    },
