      "_doc": "03 §1.1 — landing on a stage's last node heals healPctMaxHp of Max HP, refreshes reroll charges to the stage's base allotment and resets the Fair-Dice bag's reset anchor. Flat across chapters, for the same reason campfire is: a share of a run-scoped maximum takes no M(c) or G(c) scalar.",
